text = "OBJECTIVE:
Find the five wandering Prowlers across the forest. Stand within about 3 m and hold F to absorb their shadow safely; each Bloom restores its own forest clearing.

CONTROLS:
WASD - Move  ·  Mouse - Look
F - Hold to Absorb nearby Prowler
E / Right Mouse - Bloom Pulse
Shift - Dash  ·  ESC - Pause"
